% Try the new editor: ⌥-drag copies, ⇧-drag keeps it level, ⌘C/⌘V paste shorthand, ⌘R reverses an arrow,
% click a selected label to edit it (Tab walks every label), hold ⌘ for the page frame, ⌘1 is actual size.
A at 0,0
B at 1,0
C at 0,1
D at 1,1
A -f-> B
A -g-> C swap
B -h-> D
C -k-> D swap
ngon P 4 axis 1 "s" rotation cw at (6,-0.7)
blob G "G" {x, y} at (10,-0.7)
